ion: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol{\\uplambda}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-utext style=\"font-size: 88.4%; padding: 0.848em 0 0.226em 0;\" variant=\"bold\">𝛌</mjx-utext></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">λ</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> form a convex set.</p>","file":"ch18-convexity/01-convex-sets.html"}